I don't know exactly what format the tiles need to be, but here is a
quick way to generate a series of images from words in a text file:

for each x in `cat new_object_list`
{
   # imagemagick convert
    convert -size 64x64 xc:lightblue -font Arial -pointsize 16 -fill
blue \
      -annotate +5+20 "$i" "xx$i.gif";
}


